fix_text:
iLO Web UI: Administration → User Administration → Select admin account → Modify → Set a strong, unique password (minimum 12 characters, mixed case, digits, symbols).
Consider renaming the default 'admin' account to a non-obvious username.
REDFISH: PATCH /redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts/1 {"Password": "<new-password>"}

iLO Web UI: Security → Encryption → Set to 'High Security' or enable 'FIPS Mode'.
High Security mode disables TLS 1.0/1.1 and weak ciphers automatically.
REDFISH: PATCH /redfish/v1/Managers/1/SecurityService {"SecurityState": "HighSecurity"}

iLO Web UI: Administration → Remote Syslog → Enable Remote Syslog → Set syslog server IP and port (514 UDP or 6514 TCP-TLS).
Set minimum severity to 'Notice'.
REDFISH: PATCH /redfish/v1/Managers/1/RemoteSyslog {"ServiceEnabled": true, "RemoteServers": [{"Host": "<syslog-ip>", "Port": 514, "Protocol": "UDP"}]}

iLO Web UI: Security → Login Security Banner → Enable → Enter banner text:
'WARNING: Unauthorized access to this system is prohibited. All access is monitored and recorded. Disconnect immediately if not authorized.'
REDFISH: PATCH /redfish/v1/Managers/1/SecurityService {"LoginSecurityBanner": {"IsEnabled": true, "SecurityMessage": "WARNING: Authorized use only. All activity is monitored."}}
